  "full_response": "Here’s a **sample insurance claim form** with the requested details. This is a general template and can be adjusted based on the type of insurance (auto, home, health, etc.).\n\n---\n\n# **INSURANCE CLAIM FORM**\n**Policyholder Information**\n\n| **Field**               | **Details**                          |\n|-------------------------|--------------------------------------|\n| **Policyholder Name**   | John A. Doe                          |\n| **Policy Number**       | POL-2023-456789                      |\n| **Social Security No.** | XXX-XX-1234 *(Last 4 digits only for security)* |\n| **Phone Number**        | (555) 123-4567                       |\n| **Email Address**       | john.doe@email.com                   |\n| **Date of Birth**       | 05/15/1980                           |\n| **Mailing Address**     | 123 Maple Street, Springfield, IL 62704 |\n\n---\n\n### **Incident Details**\n\n| **Field**               | **Details**                          |\n|-------------------------|--------------------------------------|\n| **Date of Incident**    | 10/15/2023                           |\n| **Time of Incident**    | 3:45 PM                              |\n| **Location of Incident**| Intersection of 5th Ave & Main St, Springfield, IL |\n| **Type of Claim**       | ☑ Auto ☐ Home ☐ Health ☐ Other (Specify: ______) |\n| **Description of Incident** | *(Provide a detailed account below)* |\n\n**Description:**\nOn October 15, 2023, at approximately 3:45 PM, I was driving my 2018 Honda Accord (VIN: 1HGCV1F18JA123456) northbound on 5th Avenue when a distracted driver (red 2020 Toyota Camry, license plate IL ABC1234) ran a red light at the intersection of 5th Ave and Main St. The Toyota collided with the front passenger side of my vehicle, causing significant damage to the front bumper, headlight, and fender. The airbags did not deploy.\n\nI immediately called 911, and Officer M. Reynolds (Badge #5678) from",
